The MIT license applies to original project code and documentation.

assets/thq-connect-root.pem is the public THQ Connect Root CA certificate
extracted from the original Darksiders II PS3 1.02 client for interoperability.
Its SHA-256 fingerprint over DER is:
d86d20e06db3f01be90bb7743c1e799e776e12a09023ca5d327df8b94bf35029
No THQ private CA key is included or known. No ownership or MIT licensing of
this third-party certificate is claimed.

Darksiders, THQ and PlayStation names are used to identify the compatible game
and platform. This independent project is not endorsed by their owners.

assets/psn-darksiders2-key.json contains a public ECDSA verification point for
observed Darksiders II PSN tickets, identifier 4ca0c71d. It was recovered offline
from three independently issued operator-owned signed tickets; no Sony private
key is included or derived. The pinned key is used only to verify tickets.

psn_auth.py is an independent Python implementation of the published NP ticket
TLV/signature format. Protocol references:
https://github.com/LBPUnion/ProjectLighthouse/blob/main/Documentation/Tickets.md
https://github.com/LBPUnion/ProjectLighthouse/pull/600
The LittleBigRefresh/NPTicket implementation was consulted as a format reference;
no third-party implementation or AGPL source is copied/bundled in this release.
No ownership or MIT licensing of Sony's verification key is claimed.
